				Time="2011-10-29T09:38:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｍ・Ｂ２『グゴガガーンッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-29T09:38:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
