		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『１００倍……▼
１００倍……　１００倍……
１００倍……　１００倍……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
